00:53:33.800 --> 00:53:37.000
....This man


00:53:38.480 --> 00:53:40.200
...well


00:53:40.240 --> 00:53:42.960
So the question is, Sandra...


00:53:43.000 --> 00:53:47.800
Why were the Americans here?


00:55:07.200 --> 00:55:08.320
Again


00:55:08.360 --> 00:55:10.560
What did the American tell you?


00:55:10.600 --> 00:55:14.600
What are they after?


00:55:14.680 --> 00:55:17.480
Continue


00:55:35.880 --> 00:55:39.200
I'm going back to Valiena
Yeah? Something's changed?


00:55:39.240 --> 00:55:40.720
What is the plan?
There is no plan


00:55:40.760 --> 00:55:43.800
We need a strategy
I'm going, and you're not


00:55:43.840 --> 00:55:46.800
What?
I said I'm going and you guys are not


00:55:46.840 --> 00:55:49.600
Are you out of your mind?
It's personal business


00:55:49.640 --> 00:55:52.240
You don't owe that woman nothing
Didn't say I did


00:55:52.280 --> 00:55:54.680
If you want to kill
yourself, fine. Your call


00:55:54.720 --> 00:55:56.800
Listen, I don't want to kill myself.
You guys take care. I gotta do this


00:55:56.840 --> 00:55:58.280
I gotta do this


00:55:58.320 --> 00:55:59.240
Hey, hey!
What?


00:55:59.280 --> 00:56:01.240
Don't lay this guilt crap on us.
We don't deserve it


00:56:01.280 --> 00:56:03.440
Hey, this is my choice, there's no guilt


00:56:03.480 --> 00:56:04.840
There's no guilt


00:56:04.880 --> 00:56:07.800
Take care


00:56:11.360 --> 00:56:12.880
Yeah, fuck it, his choice


00:56:12.920 --> 00:56:15.600
Yeah...


00:56:22.400 --> 00:56:23.480
I said I'm going alone


00:56:23.520 --> 00:56:24.840
I'm going too


00:56:24.880 --> 00:56:26.800
Come on, Yang, get out


00:56:26.840 --> 00:56:29.840
Just drive


00:56:37.040 --> 00:56:40.640
Do not lose your nerve


00:56:40.680 --> 00:56:45.360
Don't talk to me, cockroach


00:56:54.240 --> 00:56:56.000
Why are you doing this?


00:56:56.040 --> 00:56:59.240
Friends die together


00:56:59.280 --> 00:57:02.440
Hey! Give me the good luck ring. Come on


00:57:02.480 --> 00:57:04.600
Don't make me hurt you, Yang. Come on


00:57:04.640 --> 00:57:06.680
Speed better than luck


00:57:06.720 --> 00:57:08.680
Whatever...


00:57:08.720 --> 00:57:10.960
It's difficult


00:57:11.000 --> 00:57:11.800
What is?


00:57:11.840 --> 00:57:14.080
My life is difficult. I need more money


00:57:14.120 --> 00:57:15.000
Why's that?


00:57:15.040 --> 00:57:17.280
I work harder than the rest
No you don't


00:57:17.320 --> 00:57:18.840
Yes I do


00:57:18.880 --> 00:57:21.720
Because they're taller
Everything's harder for me


00:57:21.760 --> 00:57:24.200
When I get hurt, the hole is bigger


00:57:24.240 --> 00:57:26.280
Because I'm smaller


00:57:26.320 --> 00:57:30.240
When I travel, I need to go further
I know, because you're smaller, right?


00:57:30.280 --> 00:57:31.920
Yes


00:57:31.960 --> 00:57:36.720
My life is harder than you think


00:57:36.760 --> 00:57:38.320
I need more money


00:57:38.360 --> 00:57:39.800
I know, you told me


00:57:39.840 --> 00:57:41.080
For your family, right?


00:57:41.120 --> 00:57:42.440
I don't have family


00:57:42.480 --> 00:57:44.760
I know


00:57:44.800 --> 00:57:48.800
Maybe one day I will


00:58:14.080 --> 00:58:15.240
Get out there!
Why me?


00:58:15.280 --> 00:58:19.480
Because you're smaller


00:58:33.920 --> 00:58:34.800
Oops


00:58:34.840 --> 00:58:39.640
Do that again, I'll kill ya!


00:59:10.880 --> 00:59:13.560
Gunner!


00:59:16.760 --> 00:59:19.320
Aww! Beautiful!


00:59:19.360 --> 00:59:22.480
That's good


00:59:51.520 --> 00:59:57.520
What are you doin'?
You're dead, junkie!


01:00:00.440 --> 01:00:03.120
Insects


01:00:24.600 --> 01:00:27.080
Shit!


01:01:01.560 --> 01:01:08.560
What are you wearing? Size 3?
Bring it, Happy Feet


01:02:07.920 --> 01:02:10.720
My turn!


01:02:17.400 --> 01:02:20.080
Gunner!


01:02:24.760 --> 01:02:27.280
Shit!


01:02:53.480 --> 01:02:56.120
You shot me


01:02:56.160 --> 01:02:58.800
Don't say that. You were gonna kill him


01:02:58.840 --> 01:03:00.800
I was just gonna scare him


01:03:00.840 --> 01:03:05.640
Don't put that on me,
you never liked him


01:03:05.680 --> 01:03:07.480
Am I dying?


01:03:07.520 --> 01:03:12.520
Shot you a couple of
inches above your heart


01:03:12.560 --> 01:03:17.040
I'll take that as a "yes"


01:03:17.720 --> 01:03:19.600
Gunner, who sent you?


01:03:19.640 --> 01:03:21.360
Who hired you?


01:03:21.400 --> 01:03:23.360
Who cares?


01:03:23.400 --> 01:03:30.440
Do yourself a favor, don't let go until you
cooperate for once in your miserable life


01:03:30.480 --> 01:03:32.480
That better make me right


01:03:32.520 --> 01:03:33.560
You got it


01:03:33.600 --> 01:03:36.920
Who sent you? Who sent you?


01:03:36.960 --> 01:03:42.560
Is the girl still alive?
Come closer


01:03:57.760 --> 01:03:59.920
You know, it's not
easy being your friend


01:03:59.960 --> 01:04:01.000
That's true


01:04:01.040 --> 01:04:04.040
Man, we'll die with you.
Just don't ask us to do it twice


01:04:04.080 --> 01:04:07.280
I know the lay out.
I'll tell you about it on the way


01:04:07.320 --> 01:04:09.120
What the hell happened to you?


01:04:09.160 --> 01:04:14.040
It's too sad to talk about it


01:04:14.440 --> 01:04:17.360
Let's fly


01:04:32.160 --> 01:04:35.200
You know, the enemy will
always be terrified of noise


01:04:35.240 --> 01:04:38.520
Especially shotguns


01:04:38.560 --> 01:04:44.880
With this big boy spittin' out 250 rounds a minute,
you tell me who's tolerating that


01:04:44.920 --> 01:04:48.200
Absolutely zero


01:04:48.240 --> 01:04:53.760
So let me get this right: Gunner tries to kill you,
you shoot him, at death's door he gives you the whole layout?


01:04:53.800 --> 01:04:55.240
It was something like that


01:04:55.280 --> 01:05:00.480
I would have win
I know you would have win


01:05:00.520 --> 01:05:02.400
You know what?


01:05:02.440 --> 01:05:03.840
I trust you


01:05:03.880 --> 01:05:06.920
Want you to meet my girlfriend


01:05:06.960 --> 01:05:09.840
Oomayah Kaboom


01:05:09.880 --> 01:05:11.080
You lost me there


01:05:11.120 --> 01:05:18.120
When Oomaya's primer strikes, she gets off
a reentry warhead that arms itself


01:05:18.160 --> 01:05:23.360
And when that happens, anything that gets in my
lady's way becomes instant red sauce and chowder


01:05:23.400 --> 01:05:28.080
And if that doesn't work...


01:05:28.760 --> 01:05:30.960
Her sister will


01:05:31.000 --> 01:05:32.520
You should meet my doctor


01:05:32.560 --> 01:05:35.360
Too late


01:06:56.400 --> 01:07:00.960
It's 3:36. We have 20 minutes to take this
place down. I'll take the cellar


01:07:01.000 --> 01:07:03.120
We've got company


01:07:03.160 --> 01:07:08.240
I've got him. You guys take off


01:07:31.800 --> 01:07:37.760
Is there a reason you've taken the soldiers this
man has trained and made them look like fools?


01:07:37.800 --> 01:07:42.120
They look like warriors


01:07:43.720 --> 01:07:47.240
Warriors loyal to me


01:07:47.280 --> 01:07:52.360
I thought the people of Valiena hired
these mercenaries to kill me


01:07:52.400 --> 01:07:55.040
But then I think,
maybe this is your plan


01:07:55.080 --> 01:07:57.080
Because you can not control me


01:07:57.120 --> 01:07:59.120
And torturing Sandra


01:07:59.160 --> 01:08:01.080
Works for you


01:08:01.120 --> 01:08:05.120
You want to kill her to make me suffer


01:08:05.160 --> 01:08:09.440
A man can never kill a child


01:08:09.480 --> 01:08:10.560
But you can


01:08:10.600 --> 01:08:13.560
Bring Sandra here


01:08:13.600 --> 01:08:15.280
Bring her now


01:08:15.320 --> 01:08:17.240
Or I will kill you


01:08:17.280 --> 01:08:20.400
Go get her!


01:11:19.840 --> 01:11:21.640
It's me


01:11:21.680 --> 01:11:24.400
It's me


01:11:25.360 --> 01:11:27.920
I won't hurt you


01:11:27.960 --> 01:11:29.320
How are you here?


01:11:29.360 --> 01:11:32.240
I just am


01:11:33.040 --> 01:11:33.520
Can you move?


01:11:33.560 --> 01:11:34.480
Yes


01:11:34.520 --> 01:11:36.720
Ok


01:11:41.920 --> 01:11:44.080
Time's up. Where's Barney?
What's the call?


01:11:44.120 --> 01:11:47.000
If he's not come in 10 minutes, we're gonna
assemble the same way we came in. -No way!


01:11:47.040 --> 01:11:49.160
This's what he wants
Ten minutes!


01:11:49.200 --> 01:11:52.000
Let's go


01:12:01.280 --> 01:12:04.480
Stop! Don't!


01:12:16.160 --> 01:12:18.480
No, don't kill him!


01:12:18.520 --> 01:12:21.800
It's not his fight, it's mine!
Get here out of here!


01:12:21.840 --> 01:12:23.840
Seal the building


01:12:23.880 --> 01:12:27.080
Stand him up


01:12:29.280 --> 01:12:31.640
If you didn't have this kevlar vest


01:12:31.680 --> 01:12:34.240
your insides are gonna
be like fuckin' mush


01:12:34.280 --> 01:12:35.440
Well ain't that a shame?


01:12:35.480 --> 01:12:36.560
You know you're a lucky man


01:12:36.600 --> 01:12:38.080
Well, I ain't feelin' lucky, man


01:12:38.120 --> 01:12:40.760
You are a lucky man


01:12:40.800 --> 01:12:42.400
He told me to keep you conscious


01:12:42.440 --> 01:12:45.040
Did he?


01:12:45.080 --> 01:12:48.760
Alright. First...


01:12:49.680 --> 01:12:51.320
you're a real tough guy, aren't you?


01:12:51.360 --> 01:12:54.280
What?
Are you a real tough guy?


01:12:54.320 --> 01:12:56.680
Look at me you piece of trash


01:12:56.720 --> 01:12:57.840
How many men you got?


01:12:57.880 --> 01:13:01.560
Just your mother!


01:13:12.280 --> 01:13:14.080
This is your last time


01:13:14.120 --> 01:13:16.520
You give me the right answer


01:13:16.560 --> 01:13:19.280
I'll cut you a break


01:13:19.320 --> 01:13:23.320
You give me the wrong answer you will die
a damned slow death. Do you understand me?


01:13:23.360 --> 01:13:25.000
Yes
Do you understand me?


01:13:25.040 --> 01:13:26.560
Yep
Who sent you?


01:13:26.600 --> 01:13:28.280
Breathe, can't breathe


01:13:28.320 --> 01:13:30.840
Loosen up


01:13:30.880 --> 01:13:34.080
Who sent you?


01:13:34.120 --> 01:13:37.800
Your hair dresser


01:15:42.680 --> 01:15:45.880
GO, MAN, GO!


01:16:04.000 --> 01:16:06.800
Come on!


01:16:28.800 --> 01:16:31.320
Shit!


01:16:50.160 --> 01:16:55.000
Remember this shit at Christmas!


01:16:55.040 --> 01:16:57.000
Damn, that thing's loud!
What happened to you?


01:16:57.040 --> 01:17:00.720
Got my ass kicked


01:17:01.160 --> 01:17:07.280
Alright, come on!
Get my rifle, let's go!


01:17:09.360 --> 01:17:12.560
What's this?


01:17:12.640 --> 01:17:15.520
Everything bad that
has happened you bring


01:17:15.560 --> 01:17:18.160
Take your money!


01:17:18.200 --> 01:17:21.520
I only see death with you.
Take it all and go!


01:17:21.560 --> 01:17:23.920
I'm not goin' anywhere
You are done here


01:17:23.960 --> 01:17:25.520
You can't succeed without me


01:17:25.560 --> 01:17:26.800
I am the leader!


01:17:26.840 --> 01:17:29.000
You're a puppet in a hat!


01:17:29.040 --> 01:17:32.240
Shut up!
No!


01:17:49.120 --> 01:17:51.520
NOW!


01:17:53.080 --> 01:17:55.960
Get back!


01:18:02.680 --> 01:18:05.800
/Throw down your weapons!


01:18:05.840 --> 01:18:09.480
/There's no way out!


01:18:09.520 --> 01:18:11.080
Shit's gettin' old!


01:18:11.120 --> 01:18:12.720
Your lucky ring stinks


01:18:12.760 --> 01:18:13.560
I know


01:18:13.600 --> 01:18:21.520
Let's backtrack
Building's rigged. This is the only way out


01:18:27.840 --> 01:18:34.840
Chopper's ready in 5 minutes
We're not leaving yet


01:18:39.320 --> 01:18:41.640
What's he saying?
He's saying we're dead with an accent


01:18:41.680 --> 01:18:43.360
We ain't dead


01:18:43.400 --> 01:18:44.840
Blow the building
Not yet


01:18:44.880 --> 01:18:50.280
We will kill this American disease


01:19:05.560 --> 01:19:08.280
Blow the building!
She's down there!


01:19:08.320 --> 01:19:11.320
The money!


01:19:14.680 --> 01:19:17.480
Blow it!


01:19:20.080 --> 01:19:22.880
Blow it!


01:19:26.760 --> 01:19:28.240
She's out!


01:19:28.280 --> 01:19:32.880
Blow the fucking building!


01:21:15.000 --> 01:21:17.800
I'm out!


01:22:08.240 --> 01:22:10.800
Let's go, come on!


01:22:10.840 --> 01:22:14.360
Cut Monroe off!


01:23:10.560 --> 01:23:13.360
Come on!


01:24:48.280 --> 01:24:49.440
Hey!


01:24:49.480 --> 01:24:51.000
It's too heavy
Give me it


01:24:51.040 --> 01:24:52.040
What do you want me to do?


01:24:52.080 --> 01:24:56.760
Throw it as high as you can


01:25:18.920 --> 01:25:19.880
Blow up the dump


01:25:19.920 --> 01:25:22.520
Got it


01:25:51.640 --> 01:25:54.120
Monroe!!


01:25:54.160 --> 01:26:00.160
Drop the weapons, or I'll
put a bullet through her eye


01:26:00.200 --> 01:26:03.520
Don't test me


01:26:12.600 --> 01:26:17.480
No No
Shut up or I'ill kill you


01:26:17.520 --> 01:26:19.920
The Agency's parasites
hired you, didn't they?


01:26:19.960 --> 01:26:23.920
I'd have paid you twice as much...
to go fishing


01:26:23.960 --> 01:26:28.080
You have to think I'm pretty freakin'
stupid to surrender to the Agency


01:26:28.120 --> 01:26:30.000
Why would I do that?


01:26:30.040 --> 01:26:31.360
I created this


01:26:31.400 --> 01:26:33.520
I made it all happen


01:26:33.560 --> 01:26:38.480
And they wanted me out. Why?
Because I saw the big picture


01:26:38.520 --> 01:26:41.400
Stop walking


01:26:41.440 --> 01:26:43.280
And what about me and you?


01:26:43.320 --> 01:26:45.240
We both the same...


01:26:45.280 --> 01:26:47.240
we're both mercenaries


01:26:47.280 --> 01:26:49.640
We're both dead inside


01:26:49.680 --> 01:26:51.600
Why the hell did you come after me?


01:26:51.640 --> 01:26:53.240
I didn't come after you, dipshit.


01:26:53.280 --> 01:26:56.680
I came for her


01:27:15.760 --> 01:27:19.080
Call it a tie


01:27:19.760 --> 01:27:21.800
Yeah, I guess so


01:27:21.840 --> 01:27:24.160
You're not as fast as you think


01:27:24.200 --> 01:27:28.880
I'm beginning to sense that


01:27:38.440 --> 01:27:42.200
Same account number as mine. It'll
help get things going around here.


01:27:42.240 --> 01:27:43.240
No, I can't


01:27:43.280 --> 01:27:45.360
You've done so much
Yeah, well, so have you


01:27:45.400 --> 01:27:46.800
Gift for a gift


01:27:46.840 --> 01:27:48.720
You take it


01:27:48.760 --> 01:27:50.760
Will you come back?


01:27:50.800 --> 01:27:55.920
I promise I'll always be around


01:28:01.560 --> 01:28:05.280
Take care, Sandra


01:28:05.400 --> 01:28:08.280
Take care


01:28:12.680 --> 01:28:15.000
Bye


01:28:39.520 --> 01:28:40.560
What?


01:28:40.600 --> 01:28:44.200
Truthfully?
Yeah


01:28:44.240 --> 01:28:50.240
I never really thought she was your type


01:29:12.160 --> 01:29:17.560
Come on, let's see what you've got


01:29:21.080 --> 01:29:24.200
Ghostdiver!


01:29:26.320 --> 01:29:31.320
Ohhhh! You... go... You... go!


01:29:32.960 --> 01:29:34.800
So, you're back from the dead


01:29:34.840 --> 01:29:36.240
How ya healin?


01:29:36.280 --> 01:29:37.600
Good


01:29:37.640 --> 01:29:39.720
Considering you could have kill me


01:29:39.760 --> 01:29:41.640
I forgive you


01:29:41.680 --> 01:29:43.440
OK


01:29:43.480 --> 01:29:44.480
I would have win


01:29:44.520 --> 01:29:47.440
Of course


01:29:48.720 --> 01:29:50.040
Hey Garner!


01:29:50.080 --> 01:29:54.280
Whatever doesn't kill you makes
you stronger, brother. Therapy


01:29:54.320 --> 01:29:58.000
Man's got a point


01:29:59.640 --> 01:30:01.640
You know what?


01:30:01.680 --> 01:30:04.200
I'm gonna do you a favor, Toole


01:30:04.240 --> 01:30:06.400
I once knew a man called Toole


01:30:06.440 --> 01:30:08.600
I love poetry


01:30:08.640 --> 01:30:13.320
to me was the epitome of cool


01:30:13.360 --> 01:30:17.760
He was good with a knife


01:30:18.440 --> 01:30:20.520
Bad with a wife


01:30:20.560 --> 01:30:24.400
That hurts
But to think he could beat me


01:30:24.440 --> 01:30:25.840
Dreaming


01:30:25.880 --> 01:30:28.720
He'd defeat me


01:30:28.760 --> 01:30:31.760
Cool Toole


01:30:32.240 --> 01:30:36.120
You gotta be a fool

